! Compatibility for older executives on the newer Director/supervisor pair.
! director/new/b01conn.imp retains the retired DMOVETOFILE implementation
! as comments. It returns flag 93 when COM_SUPVSN > "11A", before any write.
! Our supervisor is newer than that boundary. Do not silently write through
! a read-only connection or claim that the obsolete picture update succeeded.
%externalintegerfn dmovetofile(%integername length,from,to)
  %result=93
%end
%endoffile
